        defendant: [.direct("Did you take out the loan in {V}'s name?", "\"Yes, I did. I used {V}'s information after {V} died, and I thought it was acceptable because a relative told me it was fine.\""), .direct("Who gave you permission?", "\"A relative who handled {V}'s paperwork after the funeral. I thought the relative had the authority to say yes, and I did not ask for it in writing.\""), .direct("Why did you need the loan?", "\"I had bad credit and could not borrow in my own name. I needed a car to get to work, and I did not see another way.\""), .direct("What did you do with the credit cards?", "\"I used them for gas, groceries and car repairs. I thought I would pay them off, and I tried to make payments for a while.\""), .direct("What was your relationship with {V}?", "\"{V} was my sibling and we were close. When {V} died I missed {V.him} badly, and I told myself {V} would have wanted to help.\""), .direct("What did you think when the bank called?", "\"I was scared. I told the investigator about the permission and offered to repay what I owed. I should have asked about it before I signed anything.\""), .cross("You knew {V} was dead when you applied, didn't you?", "\"Yes, I knew. That is what I told myself would make it simple. I did not think through how serious it was.\""), .cross("The relative says no permission was given, doesn't the relative?", "\"The relative says so now. I remember it differently. I did not record it, and I understand that makes it hard to prove.\""), .cross("You had bad credit and no loans in your own name, didn't you?", "\"Yes. That is why I used {V}'s. I could not get approved on my own, and I took a shortcut.\""), .cross("You called the bank from your own phone about the account, didn't you?", "\"Yes. I did not hide who I was. I wanted to learn how to make payments, and I thought I was being responsible.\""), .cross("You signed with a scrawl so it would not look like your handwriting, didn't you?", "\"No. That is how I write when I am in a hurry. I did not try to disguise my signature.\"")],
