        summary: "A shouting match at a bar became a fight on {DATE}. {D} smashed a bottle against the counter and swung at {V}, cutting {V.him} across the face. {V} needed forty stitches and surgery. {DL} says {V} threw a glass first.",
        state: [E(.video, 3, "Bar Camera", "{D} breaks the bottle and swings."), E(.forensic, 3, "Medical Report", "Deep laceration requiring surgery."), E(.physical, 2, "Bottle Neck", "Held in {D}'s hand when deputies arrived.")],
        defense: [E(.statement, 2, "Glass Thrown", "{DL} says {V} threw a glass first.")],
        role: "Sheriff's deputy",
        exam: [.direct("What did you see when you arrived at the bar on {DATE}?", "\"A crowd outside and {V} on the floor with a deep cut across the face. {D} was standing with a bottle neck in hand, and the room was in an uproar.\""), .direct("What did the bar camera show?", "\"It shows {DL} smashing a bottle against the counter and swinging the broken end at {V}. The swing caught {V} across the cheek and the jaw.\""), .direct("How serious was {V}'s injury?", "\"Very. {V} needed forty stitches and later surgery. The laceration was deep and the doctors said there would be permanent scarring.\""), .direct("What was in {D}'s hand when you arrived?", "\"The neck of a broken bottle, still jagged. I told {D.him} to drop it, and {D.he} did after a few seconds.\""), .direct("What had happened before the fight?", "\"A shouting match, which the staff had warned about twice. The bartender told {D.him} to leave, and {D.he} did not go.\""), .direct("What did the defendant tell you at the scene?", "\"That {V} had thrown a glass first, and that {DL} was scared. {DL} said {D.he} did not mean to cut anyone.\""), .cross("A glass was thrown during the argument, wasn't it?", "\"Yes. A glass flew across the bar and broke on the wall. I could not tell from the camera who threw it.\""), .cross("The glass did not hit the defendant, did it?", "\"No. It missed {D.him} and hit a shelf behind the counter. I did not see any injury to {D.him} from it.\""), .cross("{D} had stopped shouting by the time of the swing, hadn't {D.he}?", "\"Not entirely. {D.He} was still angry, but the camera shows a short pause before {D.he} reached for the bottle.\""), .cross("{D} dropped the bottle when you told {D.him} to, didn't {D.he}?", "\"Yes. {D.He} cooperated and did not resist when I took {D.him} into custody.\""), .cross("You cannot say who threw the glass, can you?", "\"No. The footage is not clear. The witnesses gave different accounts, and I could not resolve it.\"")],
