        openings: ("A shouting match at a bar turned into a fight when {D} smashed a bottle against the counter and swung it at {V}. {V} needed forty stitches and surgery.", "{D} was scared when a glass flew across the bar. {D} reacted badly, but did not start the fight, and is sorry for the injury."),
