        role: "Laundromat attendant",
        exam: [.direct("What is your job at the laundromat?", "\"I am the attendant on the day shift. I keep the machines running, make change, and watch the floor. I know most of the regulars by sight.\""), .direct("What did the camera show about dryer 4?", "\"{D} opened it, pulled out a load of clothes that was not {DL}'s, put the clothes into a black bag, and left the laundromat.\""), .direct("How did you learn clothes were missing?", "\"{V} came to the counter after stepping out for quarters and said the dryer was empty. We pulled up the camera together.\""), .direct("Where was {D}'s own laundry that day?", "\"In dryer 6. {D.He} had a load going there. It was still in the dryer after {D.he} left, and it was sitting there when I checked.\""), .direct("What was recovered from the defendant's home?", "\"Some of {V}'s clothing, found when deputies went to {DL}'s address. A few items were mixed in with {DL}'s own laundry.\""), .direct("What was the value of the missing clothes?", "\"About $210, according to {V}'s loss report. That included a jacket, a few shirts, and some towels.\""), .cross("Dryers 4 and 6 are next to each other, aren't they?", "\"Yes. They are side by side in the same row. Customers do sometimes open the wrong one.\""), .cross("{D} did not hide the bag from the camera, did {D.he}?", "\"No. {D.He} carried it out in plain view. I cannot say whether {D.he} thought it was {D.his} own load.\""), .cross("{D} left a load in dryer 6, didn't {D.he}?", "\"Yes. {D.his} own clothes were still in the dryer after {D.he} left. It does not look like a person planning a theft.\""), .cross("Customers confuse loads in the dryers sometimes, don't they?", "\"It happens. It is not common to take a whole load, but I have seen small mix-ups of a sock or a shirt.\""), .cross("You did not talk to the defendant at the laundromat, did you?", "\"No. I was at the counter with {V}. {DL} had left by the time we looked at the camera.\"")],
