        openings: ("{V} left a load in a laundromat dryer to get quarters and came back to find it empty. The camera showed {D} putting the clothes into a black bag, and some were found at {D}'s home.", "{D} had two loads that day and mixed up the dryers. {D} left a full load behind, which is not what a thief does."),
