        role: "Sheriff's detective",
        exam: [.direct("What did you find when you arrived at the coin show on {DATE}?", "\"{V} had been shot behind a table and was dead at the scene. A tray of gold coins worth about $18,000 was gone, and the room was in a panic.\""), .direct("What did the hotel camera show outside the loading door?", "\"A rental car waiting with its engine running. Two masked people ran out of the door and got into the car, and it drove off at speed.\""), .direct("Whose name was on the rental agreement?", "\"{D}'s. The agreement was signed two days earlier, and the car was returned the next morning to the rental company.\""), .direct("What was recovered from the canal?", "\"A pistol that ballistics matched to the bullets that killed {V}. It was found in a canal about a quarter mile from {DL}'s home.\""), .direct("What did the autopsy show?", "\"Two gunshot wounds, either of which could have been fatal. {V} died within minutes. The medical examiner ruled it a homicide.\""), .direct("What did you find about the rental car when it was returned?", "\"The seat had been wiped down with a cleaning cloth. That is unusual for a rental, and the rental company noted it in their return report.\""), .cross("You did not find {D} in the room where the shooting happened, did you?", "\"No. No witness places {DL} inside the room. The people who ran into the loading door were masked.\""), .cross("You cannot say who fired the pistol, can you?", "\"No. We know which gun it was and that it was thrown in a canal. We do not know who held it.\""), .cross("The rental was in the defendant's name, wasn't it, which is not hidden?", "\"Yes. It was a rental in {D.his} own name. A person planning a crime might have used a false name.\""), .cross("A driver may not know what the others plan, may they?", "\"In some cases that is true. What {D.he} knew is for the jury to decide. I can only say what {D.he} did after the shooting.\""), .cross("The seat was wiped, but you do not know by whom, do you?", "\"No. I know it was wiped before return. The rental company said {D.he} returned it, and {D.he} says it was dirty.\"")],
